 (text "BLOCK 2" (at 436.88 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 61efc042-271b-50d0-ae02-26576d149aaf))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 546.10 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 64049e20-3cac-51a5-a2e7-0d9c4e5e542b))
 (text "R_ON 0.75 R, R_OFF 0 R (jumper), R_G 0.5 R per transistor, 10 k gate pull-down at the star to the Kelvin net" (at 546.10 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ef15aaf7-1b1c-509b-9aa9-def6327993f5))
 (text "GATE SUPPLY ISLANDS: external isolated supply (one HS, one LS, split per block) -> WE-CNSW -> 5.1 V Zener VDD-S, 150 R bias S-VEE: V_GS,on = +5.1 V, V_GS,off = -(V_ISO - 5.1 V)" (at 25.40 266.70 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 74584e7b-e4ba-5d4c-93a2-ee9d62408eca))
 (text "J3 / L1: HS block 1" (at 33.02 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 442dd356-75df-51b7-88e4-6a3eef8e0955))
 (text "J4 / L2: LS block 1" (at 236.22 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 39bec625-fa6c-5a72-8795-3441859a7979))
 (text "J12 / L6: HS block 2" (at 439.42 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9dd665f9-f29c-5cde-864b-2de83924025b))
 (text "J13 / L7: LS block 2" (at 642.62 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c5ae121d-5809-509a-89b6-0acfe59520a0))
 (text "U.FL MEASUREMENT PORTS (bottom side, at each cell): V_GS HS / LS (0 R, shield = Kelvin), V_DS LS (953 R series = 20:1 into the 50 R scope input, shield = LS source = DC-)" (at 25.40 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5c76d853-7973-596e-98f4-f9c5e393f7c1))
 (text "MOUNTING: H1-H4 board corners (insulated), H5-H7 heatsink spreader; heatsink HS1 (Fischer LAM 4, 100 mm, rotated 90 deg, tube across the board width) is a board-only item" (at 25.40 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 881cd126-7f8b-5784-86d7-32de5a8ac2ff))
 (text "Nets: DCP = DC+, DCN = DC-, SW = joined switch node of all four cells.  KH1/KH2 and KL1/KL2 are the Kelvin source nets (pad 2 of each EPC2361); they meet the power source only inside the package." (at 25.40 414.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid af5b2fdb-de88-50ea-83d7-17a5c0f67b7d))
 (text "LS power source = DC- directly (no shunt).  The LS gate drive and the LS supply are referenced to the Kelvin net KLx, not to DC-." (at 25.40 419.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ec72a547-41eb-5585-8096-8a1dabb0354f))
 (text "Block suffix 1/2 on every driver-side net (GNDI1, VDDA2, ...).  Primary side: GNDIx and +12Vx come from the control header through a common-mode choke per pair (12 V/GND, PWM_H/PWM_L, DIS)." (at 25.40 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8ba96e42-3412-5a5f-937e-98422cdf2a6b))
 (text "No short-circuit protection on this board.  Closed-loop control from a TI TMS320F28379D over the CTRL headers." (at 25.40 429.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3d9fe1ec-4908-53f7-baaf-94a57fc7bfc2))
